{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "availability": "available",
      "content_state": "enhanced",
      "copy_key": "career.block.quick-decision",
      "id": "quick-decision",
      "items": [
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "如果你愿意同时打磨课程、引导讨论、严谨评分并长期跟进学科文献，这条路径值得试做。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "psychology-teachers-postsecondary.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "核心不是只会讲：要能把目标、文献、活动、评价与学生反馈对齐，并区分教学、研究和临床责任。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "psychology-teachers-postsecondary.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "安全桌面练习只审三张虚构微课卡的7字段：学习者、目标、文献/证据、活动、评价/量规、无障碍/隐私、升级安排（触发+对象）。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "psychology-teachers-postsecondary.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "A：大一导论课；目标是区分相关与因果；S24/D25两篇虚构摘要；概念图活动；评价/量规未知；有替代文本且无个人数据；“量规缺失则升级课程负责人”，缺1。B：研究生方法课；目标是评析量表效度；文献/证据未知；匿名案例评析；4级量规；无障碍/隐私未知；“任一来源/隐私不明则升级教学主管”，缺2。C：大二发展心理课；目标是比较两种理论；两条虚构DOI摘要；案例矩阵；3项量规；文字稿且无个人数据；“引用不一致时升级项目主任”，缺0。三卡都不授权真实教学。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "psychology-teachers-postsecondary.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.4",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "availability": "available",
