      "items": [
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.definition-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "职业定义：25-1066.00讲授儿童、临床、发展、心理咨询等心理学课程，包括教学为主与教学研究并重的教师。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "psychology-teachers-postsecondary.profile.definition-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.responsibilities-block",
          "data": {
            "entries": [
              "准备并讲授本科或研究生课程。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "psychology-teachers-postsecondary.profile.responsibilities-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "list"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.responsibilities-block",
          "data": {
            "entries": [
              "组织讨论，评价作业、论文、实验和考试。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "psychology-teachers-postsecondary.profile.responsibilities-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "list"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.responsibilities-block",
          "data": {
            "entries": [
              "修订课程材料，指导学生教学、实习与研究工作。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "psychology-teachers-postsecondary.profile.responsibilities-block.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "list"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.work-context-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "工作还可包含阅读最新文献、学术会议、研究发表、学生咨询与院系行政。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "psychology-teachers-postsecondary.profile.work-context-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.work-context-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "教学、研究、学生指导和行政比重会因院校与合同而异。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "psychology-teachers-postsecondary.profile.work-context-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.onet-structured-fields-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "输入是培养目标、文献、学生作品与院校规则；产出是课程、评价、反馈、指导和可选研究成果。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "psychology-teachers-postsecondary.profile.onet-structured-fields-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-quick-answers-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "一句话：这是把心理学知识转化为可学习、可评价、可改进的高校课程。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "psychology-teachers-postsecondary.profile.career-quick-answers-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-quick-answers-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "质量要看目标—活动—评价是否对齐，证据与反馈是否可追溯。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "psychology-teachers-postsecondary.profile.career-quick-answers-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.definition-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "教师条目中的临床监督/服务是补充任务，不证明所有高校心理学教师都有临床资格或责任。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "psychology-teachers-postsecondary.profile.definition-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial",
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
      ]
