          "data": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "answer": "O*NET 25-1066.00包括为本科生或研究生准备并讲授心理学课程、组织讨论、评价作业考试、修订课程，也包括教学为主及教学研究并重的教师。",
                "id": "psychology-teachers-postsecondary.faq.1",
                "question_key": "career.faq.psychology-teachers-postsecondary.daily-work",
                "source_refs": [
                  "onet-details"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "25-1066.00的主干是高校心理学教学及可选研究；19-3033.00的主干是对个人心理与情绪障碍进行评估、诊断和治疗，两者不能因“心理学”头衔互换。",
                "id": "psychology-teachers-postsecondary.faq.2",
                "question_key": "career.faq.psychology-teachers-postsecondary.role-comparison",
                "source_refs": [
                  "onet-clinical",
                  "onet-details"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "适配与谨慎信号是基于教学任务的自我观察框架，不是性格诊断或雇佣结论。",
                "id": "psychology-teachers-postsecondary.faq.3",
                "question_key": "career.faq.psychology-teachers-postsecondary.fit",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "O*NET 2025美国招聘信息显示Office 3%、PowerPoint 1%、Excel 1%、Outlook低于1%，其他所列软件百分比不可用；这不是生成式AI采用或替代率。",
                "id": "psychology-teachers-postsecondary.faq.4",
                "question_key": "career.faq.psychology-teachers-postsecondary.ai-impact",
                "source_refs": [
                  "onet-tech"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "AI可帮助整理大纲、题目初稿和文献线索，但教师必须复核原始文献、教学目标、题目答案、评分标准、学生数据与教学公平。",
                "id": "psychology-teachers-postsecondary.faq.5",
                "question_key": "career.faq.psychology-teachers-postsecondary.human-control",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "国家统计局2024年工资资料按行业与人员大类聚合，不能作为高校心理学教师的全国精确工资。",
                "id": "psychology-teachers-postsecondary.faq.6",
                "question_key": "career.faq.psychology-teachers-postsecondary.china-pay",
                "source_refs": [
                  "nbs-wages"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "BLS 2025年心理学高校教师年工资中位数为80,340美元；当前已开表不提供该职业工资分位数。",
                "id": "psychology-teachers-postsecondary.faq.7",
                "question_key": "career.faq.psychology-teachers-postsecondary.us-pay",
                "source_refs": [
                  "bls-proj"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "BLS将该职业典型入门教育列为博士或专业学位，无典型相关工作经验，无典型在职培训；这是统计典型值而非所有院校的统一招聘规则。",
                "id": "psychology-teachers-postsecondary.faq.8",
                "question_key": "career.faq.psychology-teachers-postsecondary.education-path",
                "source_refs": [
                  "bls-training"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "对评分证据、学生记录、研究/临床场景和权限不明的情况，只记录并按院校现行程序升级；本页不规定处置步骤。",
                "id": "psychology-teachers-postsecondary.faq.9",
                "question_key": "career.faq.psychology-teachers-postsecondary.risk-boundary",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "BLS预计该职业就业从2025年52,300增至2035年54,400，增长4.0%、净增2,100，年均空缺3,700。",
                "id": "psychology-teachers-postsecondary.faq.10",
                "question_key": "career.faq.psychology-teachers-postsecondary.outlook-transition",
                "source_refs": [
                  "bls-proj"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "就业预测与年均空缺是美国总体统计，职业选择还应核对教学/研究比重、合同类型与院校要求。",
                "id": "psychology-teachers-postsecondary.faq.11",
                "question_key": "career.faq.psychology-teachers-postsecondary.career-worth",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
